        <mxCell id="title-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#232F3E;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;AWS infrastructure, as built&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#545B64&quot;&gt;One deployment per hospital: ten CDK stacks in one account and one EU region. The browser talks only to CloudFront, Cognito and API Gateway; every clinical data call goes through the dispatcher. The reference servers stand in for the hospital&#39;s systems until those are reachable; the hospital&#39;s own servers are reached with OAuth 2.0 client credentials.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="1700" x="60" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
